    "scenesThatPass": [
      "EMMA: I’m sorry...\nRACHEL: What about leading with something funnier? Something less emotional?\nEMMA: No, I’ll get through it on the day. I don’t know why I’m being so sensitive right now.\nRACHEL: What about the first time you met? Wasn’t that kind of a funny story?",
      "RACHEL: I bet that was on purpose.\nALICE: What about the time you made me call your doctor, when you thought you’d been drugged.\nRACHEL: What?\nEMMA: Oh my god, I almost forgot about that.",
      "EMMA: Yeah, text me.\nALICE: You OK?\nEMMA: I’m just gonna.. Two seconds.",
      "INSTRUCTOR: It’s good! It’s classic, it’s romantic, and we’re getting so close.\nEMMA: OK, what about... Two seconds. Just hear me out.\nINSTRUCTOR: What’s this?",
      "RACHEL: Did you talk to her?\nEMMA: No.. She didn’t see us."
    ]
